  "description": "SQLite provider for EntitySpaces ORM. Fully modernized for .NET Framework 4.8, .NET 8, 9, and 10. Features strongly-typed entities, dynamic SQL, stored procedures, safe connection pooling, thread‑safe caching, and automatic concurrency detection.",
